  _description: 'Per-thread retirement indicator (world.<threadId>.thread_retired), written once by
    the thread maintenance tick when a thread retires without a payoff: "expired" (ephemeral
    timeout) or "conflict" (premise contradicted). Read later by the quest-log / thread readout; no
    closure beat is placed.'
